5744,49.3,2005,56,106,27],[15745,50.0,2005,61,102,27]],"links":[["Caddo Parish in the Farmland Atlas","/farmland-atlas/louisiana/caddo-parish"],["ARC or PLC in Caddo Parish","/arc-plc/louisiana/caddo-parish"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 15 grids in Caddo Parish came in under 90% of normal in October to November 38 times in 75 years, more than any other pair since 1951. In 2025 the middle ran 157% of normal in April to May, then fell to 52% in November to December. So far in 2026 it sat at 49% in February to March, and the preliminary estimate for grid 14845 in August to September 2026 is 29.3.</p>"}
